      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that the void is the only constant is a heavy, but understandable, place to land when everything familiar is gone. You don't have to force yourself to \"rebuild\" or find a whole new self right now; survival is enough for this moment. Sometimes, the only sensible thing to do is simply allow yourself to exist within the quiet, without the pressure of having to perform or be whole.",
